/li><li><span class="rf-year">1561</span><span class="rf-text">Reval submits to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eric-xiv-of-sweden">Eric XIV of Sweden</a> during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livonian-war">Livonian War</a></span></li></ol>
